    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present No. 6 Carrigmore Downs, a well maintained 2-bedroom own-door apartment in the highly sought-after Carrigmore development. This superb property comes to the market in good condition, is vacant, and benefits from no onward chain.\n\nThe apartment has been recently upgraded and refreshed throughout, featuring upgraded flooring, a newly installed water pump, and a fresh paint finish. It also benefits from gas-fired central heating with Climote smart control, offering both comfort and energy efficiency, reflected in its C2 BER rating. Double-glazed windows further enhance warmth and insulation.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation comprises an entrance porch, a large open-plan living/dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, two generous double bedrooms (one with access to a private patio), and a family bathroom. The living areas are flooded with natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.\n\nA standout feature of this property is that it is being sold fully furnished, with all appliances and furniture included, making it an ideal turnkey option for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors.\n\nSet in a quiet estate, the property enjoys a peaceful setting with stunning views of the Dublin Mountains with access to a beautiful common green space. It is ideally located within walking distance of Saggart Village and the LUAS, while also offering easy access to the M50, N7, N81, and Belgard Road. A wide range of amenities are nearby, including schools, shops, cafés, and recreational facilities.\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a ready-to-move-in home in a well-connected and desirable location. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPlease see 3D Tour for layout & dimensions - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=aEgbcosPTtb\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 2 Bed, own door apartment c. 70 Sqm</li><li> Vacant with no onward chain</li><li> Fully furnished all appliances included</li><li> Recently painted with upgraded flooring</li><li> Gas-fired central heating with Climote smart control</li><li> C2 energy rating</li><li> Upgraded water pump system</li><li> 2 parking discs available - communal parking</li><li> Private patio access from bedroom</li><li> Management fee 1200</ul>"
      },
